---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <main class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-10 py-10 md:py-14 lg:py-20">

    <div class="text-center mb-10 lg:mb-14">
      <h1 class="text-[36px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] text-muted">
        Last updated: March 2025
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-content space-y-8">

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Masjid Al-Hikmah Islamic Centre ("we", "us", or "our") is the data controller responsible for your personal data. We are a registered charity in England and Wales (Charity No. 1041977).
        </p>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about this policy or how we handle your data, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-light-bg rounded-xl text-[15px] text-navy space-y-1">
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@masjidalhikmah.co.uk" class="text-teal hover:text-navy transition-colors">info@masjidalhikmah.co.uk</a></p>
          <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:02084722745" class="text-teal hover:text-navy transition-colors">020 8472 2745</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">2. What Data We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We collect personal data in the following circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal/15 text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] font-bold mt-0.5">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Online Donations</p>
              <p class="text-[14px] lg:text-[15px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Your name, email address, and payment details (processed securely by Stripe). We also store the donation amount, fund, and frequency. If you opt in to Gift Aid, we additionally record your home address.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal/15 text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] font-bold mt-0.5">2</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Contact Enquiries</p>
              <p class="text-[14px] lg:text-[15px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Your name, email address, phone number, and the content of your message when you contact us through our website or by email.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal/15 text-teal flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] font-bold mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Website Usage</p>
              <p class="text-[14px] lg:text-[15px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Standard server logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited, time and date of visits). This data is not linked to individual identities and is used solely for maintaining and improving the website.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-[14px] lg:text-[15px] text-muted mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We do not collect any special category data (such as religious beliefs, health data, or biometric data) through this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-[14px] lg:text-[15px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b-2 border-navy/10">
                <th class="text-left py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-navy">Purpose</th>
                <th class="text-left py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-navy">Lawful Basis</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-navy/5">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Processing your donation and issuing a receipt</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">Contractual necessity</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Claiming Gift Aid on your behalf (where applicable)</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">Legal obligation (HMRC requirement)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Responding to your contact enquiry</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">Legitimate interests</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Sending donation updates or appeals (only with your consent)</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">Consent</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Maintaining website security and performance</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">Legitimate interests</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Complying with legal and regulatory obligations</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">Legal obligation</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">4. Payment Processing (Stripe)</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3">
          All online payments are processed by <strong class="text-navy">Stripe</strong>, a PCI DSS-compliant payment processor. We do not store your full card details on our systems at any point — this data is held by Stripe under their own privacy policy.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Stripe may set cookies on your device as part of the checkout process. You can review Stripe's privacy policy at <a href="https://stripe.com/gb/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-teal hover:text-navy transition-colors">stripe.com/gb/privacy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">5. Sharing Your Data</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We do not sell or rent your personal data. We may share it only in the following limited circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-teal font-bold mt-1">—</span><span><strong class="text-navy">Stripe</strong> — to process your payment</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-teal font-bold mt-1">—</span><span><strong class="text-navy">HMRC</strong> — to claim Gift Aid where you have elected to do so</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-teal font-bold mt-1">—</span><span><strong class="text-navy">Legal obligation</strong> — if required by law, court order, or competent authority</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">6. How Long We Keep Your Data</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-[14px] lg:text-[15px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b-2 border-navy/10">
                <th class="text-left py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-navy">Data Type</th>
                <th class="text-left py-3 font-semibold text-navy">Retention Period</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-navy/5">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Donation records</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">7 years (HMRC requirement)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Gift Aid declarations</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">6 years after the last donation claimed</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Contact enquiries</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">2 years from the date of enquiry</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-muted">Server logs</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-muted">90 days</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Under UK GDPR you have the following rights:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {[
            ['Right of access', 'You can request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.'],
            ['Right to rectification', 'You can ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete data.'],
            ['Right to erasure', 'You can request deletion of your data where there is no compelling reason to keep it.'],
            ['Right to restrict processing', 'You can ask us to pause processing your data in certain circumstances.'],
            ['Right to object', 'You can object to processing based on legitimate interests.'],
            ['Right to withdraw consent', 'Where processing is based on consent, you can withdraw it at any time without affecting prior processing.'],
          ].map(([title, desc]) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="shrink-0 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal mt-2.5"></span>
              <span class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted"><strong class="text-navy">{title}:</strong> {desc}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted mt-5 leading-relaxed">
          To exercise any of these rights, please email <a href="mailto:info@masjidalhikmah.co.uk" class="text-teal hover:text-navy transition-colors">info@masjidalhikmah.co.uk</a>. We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">8. Complaints</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed">
          If you believe we have mishandled your personal data, you have the right to lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO), the UK supervisory authority for data protection. You can contact the ICO at <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-teal hover:text-navy transition-colors">ico.org.uk</a> or call 0303 123 1113. We would appreciate the opportunity to address your concerns directly before you contact the ICO.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-[24px] border-2 border-navy/5 p-8 lg:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-bold text-navy mb-4">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
